{"publicId":"283d16b5-455a-43b9-ad56-45c7b0e13e62","title":"GHO供应量因DefiLlama会计调整骤降61%","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-14T00:26:16.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-14T00:26:16.000Z","digest":"DefiLlama于2026年11月14日宣布将闲置预铸GHO从流通供应量中排除，导致GHO流通量单日骤降61%（早先统计为6990万枚，现仅剩2730万枚）。该调整使GHO实际流通量与合约总发行量（6990万枚）产生3620万枚差异，反映会计方法从'总发行量=流通量'改为'流通量=活跃持仓量'。市场分析认为需重新评估GHO在以太坊生态中的实际供应量影响，但未涉及具体交易限制或代币销毁行为。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-14T05:22:59.891Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"GHO 供应量减少 61% 反映会计变更","latestReport":{"id":"f8gwfz0cixium4wwc8cyl3dtk"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fenhZoruFtlE","title":"GHO's 61% Supply Drop Reflects an Accounting Change","firstReportAt":"2026-11-14T00:26:16.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"f8gwfz0cixium4wwc8cyl3dtk","title":"GHO 供应量减少 61% 反映会计变更","summary":"DefiLlama 现已不再将闲置的、预铸造的 GHO 计入流通供应量，尽管 Ethereum 合约仍报告发行了 699 百万枚 GHO。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T00:26:16.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"f8gwfz0cixium4wwc8cyl3dtk","title":"GHO 供应量减少 61% 反映会计变更","summary":"DefiLlama 现已不再将闲置的、预铸造的 GHO 计入流通供应量，尽管 Ethereum 合约仍报告发行了 699 百万枚 GHO。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T00:26:16.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-14T07:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T08:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T09:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T10:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T11:00:00.000Z","heat":7.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T12:00:00.000Z","heat":7.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T13:00:00.000Z","heat":7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T14:00:00.000Z","heat":6.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T15:00:00.000Z","heat":6.6,"participant